"""Seed the RM scorecards: 12 roles, their KPI lines and their weights.

Taken from ``Portfolio Management - Q3 2026_scorecards.xlsb`` - the eight RM
role cards, read cell by cell - and from the calibration recorded in
``docs/rm-scorecard-kpi-map.csv``, where each line's actuals block was
established by reproducing the ACTUAL the card itself states.

ARMs and BBCs use their segment's RM card, confirmed by the desk, so the twelve
roles on the ``List`` roster map onto eight cards.

Seed-only-if-empty, like 0020 and 0023: if somebody has already configured a
KPI or a mapping this does nothing, because a seed that overwrote a desk's
tuning would be worse than one that never ran.

A KPI whose actuals block could not be established carries
``not_configured_reason`` and is deliberately left inactive. Defaulting it to
block 1 would put Banca premiums 860x out, and a wrong figure on a scorecard is
worse than an absent one.
"""

